<section class="ah-admin-section delivery-settings" data-delivery-settings hidden aria-labelledby="delivery-settings-heading">
  <div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="delivery-settings-heading">报名通知与票券</h2><p>申请回执、正式确认与行前提醒分别记录。</p></div><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-delivery-refresh>重新读取设置</button></div>
  <p class="ah-admin-error" data-delivery-error role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
  <p class="delivery-status" data-delivery-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div class="delivery-pending" data-delivery-pending hidden><p>上次操作结果尚待确认。请保留本页，再次确认同一操作；不会另建发送请求。</p><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-delivery-retry>再次确认同一操作</button></div>
  <div data-delivery-state hidden>
    <div class="delivery-summary"><article><h3>确认邮件</h3><p data-delivery-mail-ready></p></article><article><h3 id="wallet-settings-title">Apple Wallet</h3><p data-delivery-wallet-ready></p><p class="delivery-muted" data-delivery-wallet-expiry hidden></p></article></div>
    <form data-delivery-automatic><h3>报名通知</h3><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" /> 启用报名通知</label><p class="delivery-muted">新申请寄回执，核准后寄确认；行前提醒由下方手动发出。关闭后全部暂停，不补寄历史记录。</p><div class="ah-form-save-actions"><p class="ah-form-save-state" data-delivery-save-state data-save-state="loaded" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未修改</p><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-delivery-save-button>保存</button></div></form>
    <section class="delivery-formal delivery-reminders" aria-labelledby="formal-heading">
      <div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><h3 id="formal-heading">正式确认信</h3><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-formal-refresh>读取确认信名单</button></div>
      <p class="delivery-muted" data-formal-status role="status" aria-live="polite">选择需要寄送确认信的人员；已接收或结果待核对者不会重复寄送。</p>
      <form data-delivery-dispatch>
        <div data-formal-preview hidden>
          <details class="delivery-guide"><summary>预览确认信内容</summary><strong data-formal-subject></strong><pre class="delivery-message" data-formal-message></pre></details>
          <label><input type="checkbox" data-formal-retry-rejected /> 已核对原因，允许重试明确未发出的确认信</label>
          <div class="delivery-reminder-selection"><label><input type="checkbox" data-formal-select-all /> 选择本页可发送人员</label><p data-formal-selection></p></div>
          <ul class="delivery-reminder-rows" data-formal-rows tabindex="0" aria-label="确认信收件人名单"></ul>
          <p class="delivery-muted" data-formal-empty hidden>暂无已确认名额的人员。</p>
          <div class="contacts-action-row"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-formal-next hidden>下一页</button><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-formal-send disabled>发送确认信（0 人）</button></div>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class="delivery-pending" data-formal-pending hidden><p>原确认信结果待核对，不会重寄。</p><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-formal-lookup>核对原寄送</button></div>
      <div data-delivery-legacy-pending hidden></div>
      <div class="delivery-pending" data-formal-legacy-recovery hidden><p>有旧确认信操作待核对，不会重建或重寄。</p><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-formal-legacy-lookup>核对旧操作</button></div>
      <div class="delivery-reminder-results" data-formal-results hidden></div>
    </section>
    <section class="delivery-reminders" aria-labelledby="reminder-heading">
      <div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><h3 id="reminder-heading">行前提醒</h3><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-reminder-refresh>读取提醒名单</button></div>
      <p class="delivery-muted" data-reminder-status role="status" aria-live="polite">先核对当前已确认名额，再选择收件人。</p>
      <form data-reminder-form>
        <div data-reminder-preview hidden>
          <details class="delivery-guide"><summary>预览提醒内容</summary><strong data-reminder-subject></strong><pre class="delivery-message" data-reminder-message></pre></details>
          <label><input type="checkbox" data-reminder-retry-rejected /> 已核对原因，允许重试明确未发出的提醒</label>
          <div class="delivery-reminder-selection"><label><input type="checkbox" data-reminder-select-all /> 选择本页可发送人员</label><p data-reminder-selection></p></div>
          <ul class="delivery-reminder-rows" data-reminder-rows></ul>
          <p class="delivery-muted" data-reminder-empty hidden>暂无已确认名额的人员。</p>
          <div class="contacts-action-row"><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-reminder-next hidden>下一页</button><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" data-reminder-send disabled>发送提醒（0 人）</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="delivery-pending" data-reminder-pending hidden><p>上次提醒结果待核对，不会重寄。</p><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-reminder-lookup>核对原寄送</button></div>
      </form>
      <div class="delivery-reminder-results" data-reminder-results hidden></div>
    </section>
    <details class="delivery-guide"><summary>通知记录</summary><h3>正式确认</h3><dl class="delivery-counts" data-delivery-counts></dl><div data-delivery-notification-counts></div></details>
    <details class="delivery-guide" data-delivery-setup-guide><summary>设置指南</summary><h3>确认邮件</h3><ul data-delivery-mail-missing></ul><ol><li>在 EmailJS 连接寄件账号，建立报名确认模板。</li><li>按指引加入服务、模板与寄件配置。</li><li>状态可用后再开启报名通知，并核对测试邮箱。</li></ol><a href="https://github.com/kunanli/artdicohost/blob/main/docs/registration-confirmation.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看确认信设置指引</a><h3>Apple Wallet</h3><ul data-delivery-wallet-missing hidden></ul><p class="delivery-muted" data-delivery-wallet-device hidden>设置后仍需用真实 iPhone 验证加入 Wallet。</p><ol><li>完成 Apple Developer 注册，建立活动的 Pass Type ID。</li><li>准备签章证书、私钥、Apple WWDR 与根证书。</li><li>按受控指引验证并上传加密设置包；私钥不填入网页。</li><li>用真实 iPhone 验证后再开放票券。</li></ol><a href="https://github.com/kunanli/artdicohost/blob/main/docs/apple-wallet-setup.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 Wallet 设置与轮替指引</a></details>
  </div>
</section>
